{"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.01503362627507665,"c":1,"w":0.08083459218343092,"y":0.048467493237774439,"t":"Reading","x":0.8292256076332255},{"h":0.016069835899150564,"c":1,"t":"The British iron industry also underwent major change as it adopted new innovations.","x":0.075975352968238499,"y":0.094395280259990999,"w":0.80287475585937507},{"t":"Chief among the new techniques was the smelting of iron ore with coke (a material","y":0.11181158421052084,"w":0.77833206176757819,"c":1,"h":0.018887034278352033,"x":0.075923918315019143},{"y":0.13067846602156241,"c":1,"h":0.016224188790560423,"t":"made by heating coal) instead of the traditional charcoal. This method was cheaper","w":0.78439422607421871,"x":0.075975371436835526},{"w":0.77425872802734375,"h":0.020434509547410773,"x":0.075911523353621252,"c":1,"t":"and produced metals that were of a higher quality, enabling Britain's iron and steel","y":0.14641882307632026},{"y":0.16430599441600058,"w":0.83376251220703124,"t":"production to expand in response to demand created by the Napoleonic Wars (1803-15)","h":0.018851681937158693,"x":0.075934319401700923,"c":1},{"t":"and the expansion of the railways from the 1830s.","y":0.18459302336973238,"w":0.47227925618489586,"h":0.015996947049391363,"x":0.075975361538929462,"c":1},{"t":"The latter part of the Industrial Revolution also saw key advances in communication","w":0.78644765218098955,"h":0.015996089586466145,"c":1,"x":0.075975352448547251,"y":0.2194690265726813},{"c":1,"h":0.017487308761011566,"t":"methods, as people increasingly saw the need to communicate efficiently over long","x":0.07597535863064081,"y":0.23687315632538719,"w":0.78028747558593747},{"h":0.018978527372917275,"x":0.075975361097219238,"t":"distances. In 1837, British inventors William Cooke and Charles Wheatstone patented","c":1,"w":0.8069815063476562,"y":0.25427728589440113},{"h":0.017541332301136969,"c":1,"y":0.27315634208858153,"t":"the first commercial telegraphy system. In the 1830s and 1840s, Samuel Morse","w":0.74743326822916667,"x":0.073921969476606939},{"h":0.017699115044247815,"t":"and other inventors worked on their own versions in the United States. Cooke and","y":0.29056047193440482,"c":1,"x":0.075975351918741676,"w":0.77002054850260415},{"c":1,"w":0.80105234781901036,"h":0.022233577041851138,"y":0.30616643956306011,"x":0.075843767636806655,"t":"Wheatstone's system was soon used for railway signalling in the UK. As the speed of"},{"y":0.32703488374486334,"t":"the new locomotives increased, it was essential to have a fast and effective means of","h":0.017507888996495691,"c":1,"w":0.80492813110351558,"x":0.07392197130655831},{"y":0.34447674428563979,"h":0.015995232123540815,"t":"avoiding collisions.","c":1,"x":0.075975358598656437,"w":0.18069815317789711},{"w":0.75577117919921877,"y":0.37809541971592653,"h":0.018760710409608805,"c":1,"t":"The impact of the Industrial Revolution on people's lives was immense. Although","x":0.075912693358381494},{"t":"many people in Britain had begun moving to the cities from rural areas before the","c":1,"x":0.075975351681210737,"y":0.39823008849299646,"w":0.76180699666341145,"h":0.016014097433174612},{"y":0.41563421824696301,"t":"Industrial Revolution, this accelerated dramatically with industrialisation, as the rise","w":0.78028747558593758,"x":0.073921970504340212,"h":0.017505316607719923,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.77016911824544265,"y":0.43182660987485089,"t":"of large factories turned smaller towns into major cities in just a few decades. This","h":0.019444824038705288,"x":0.073853856607202978},{"h":0.017699115044247815,"y":0.45191740400960922,"t":"rapid urbanisation brought significant challenges, as overcrowded cities suffered from","x":0.073921964883168989,"w":0.80287475585937496,"c":1},{"h":0.016068978436225234,"x":0.075975357226015491,"y":0.46947674429797315,"t":"pollution and inadequate sanitation.","w":0.33675565083821613,"c":1},{"x":0.073921959235595983,"t":"Although industrialisation increased the country's economic output overall and improved","y":0.50436046523131239,"w":0.82546203613281255,"h":0.015993517197690599,"c":1},{"h":0.017452150530519739,"y":0.52325581397736265,"x":0.073921977988873191,"t":"the standard of living for the middle and upper classes, many poor people continued to","w":0.81519505818684879,"c":1},{"t":"struggle. Factory workers had to work long hours in dangerous conditions for extremely","y":0.54069767453382866,"w":0.82135523478190098,"h":0.015988371857499573,"x":0.073921971819309817,"c":1},{"t":"low wages. These conditions along with the rapid pace of change fuelled opposition","x":0.071868582708020864,"y":0.55811209440559628,"h":0.017469300914303099,"c":1,"w":0.78850102742513006},{"h":0.01898195722461804,"y":0.57404129808942728,"x":0.071868582951305007,"c":1,"t":"to industrialisation. A group of British workers who became known as 'Luddites' were","w":0.79671457926432276},{"c":1,"t":"British weavers and textile workers who objected to the increased use of mechanised","h":0.016069835899150342,"y":0.59439528026009181,"w":0.79876795450846361,"x":0.075975365558909977},{"x":0.071868576807722392,"y":0.61179941001345761,"w":0.80287475585937496,"h":0.017699115044247815,"c":1,"t":"looms and knitting frames. Many had spent years learning their craft, and they feared"},{"h":0.016224188790560534,"c":1,"y":0.63067846602232336,"w":0.81930185953776047,"t":"that unskilled machine operators were robbing them of their livelihood. A few desperate","x":0.073921965404090226},{"c":1,"w":0.77618067423502601,"h":0.016050970589516766,"t":"weavers began breaking into factories and smashing textile machines. They called","y":0.6482558140688639,"x":0.073921983120925086},{"c":1,"y":0.66569767443529471,"t":"themselves Luddites after Ned Ludd, a young apprentice who was rumoured to have","x":0.071868582792175645,"w":0.79671457926432276,"h":0.017488166223936674},{"h":0.015996947049391363,"t":"wrecked a textile machine in 1779.","x":0.073921975315105137,"y":0.68459302336765404,"c":1,"w":0.33059547424316404},{"x":0.07392196253353793,"w":0.72895278930664065,"c":1,"y":0.71946902657257727,"t":"The first major instances of machine breaking took place in 1811 in the city of","h":0.015996089586466145},{"x":0.075914378748127259,"y":0.73538681029696518,"t":"Nottingham, and the practice soon spread across the country. Machine-breaking","w":0.75166839599609381,"h":0.018995400937960927,"c":1},{"t":"Luddites attacked and burned factories, and in some cases they even exchanged","c":1,"w":0.76386037190755218,"x":0.073921970001049428,"y":0.75575221224309241,"h":0.017503601681869707},{"x":0.073921963824921305,"w":0.77002054850260415,"h":0.016224188790560534,"c":1,"t":"gunfire with company guards and soldiers. The workers wanted employers to stop","y":0.77315634218020823},{"h":0.017699115044247704,"w":0.77618067423502601,"y":0.7905604719320769,"c":1,"x":0.073921983126267035,"t":"installing new machinery, but the British government responded to the uprisings by"},{"x":0.073921977523876498,"t":"making machine-breaking punishable by death. The unrest finally reached its peak in","w":0.7987679545084635,"y":0.80813953490633061,"h":0.017524181917353721,"c":1},{"h":0.017486451298086347,"w":0.82340861002604171,"x":0.073921987466445099,"t":"April 1812, when a few Luddites were shot during an attack on a mill near Huddersfield.","y":0.82558139515698326,"c":1},{"w":0.79260777791341142,"c":1,"h":0.015995232123540926,"y":0.84447674430138586,"x":0.071868595530258303,"t":"In the days that followed, other Luddites were arrested, and dozens were hanged or"},{"h":0.017441860412777732,"c":1,"w":0.73100616455078127,"t":"transported to Australia. By 1813, the Luddite resistance had all but vanished.","y":0.86191860467423953,"x":0.073921968964651891},{"x":0.88090349162886827,"c":1,"y":0.92296511634307521,"w":0.026694043477376361,"h":0.014534883302221635,"t":"41"},{"y":0.939023246385844,"h":0.047780971470835598,"c":1,"x":0.51825223579186064,"w":0.45180328369140621,"t":"IELTSXpress.com"}],"h":3390}